    "○ Continuous weft insertion - Aramid, Carbon fiber - 3K up to 50K\r\n○ Continuously moved to the knitting unit - mainly to produce carbon, aramid fiber products - 3K up to 50K \r\n○ Weft and rpm - up to 600 mm weft insertion band width - up to 2,000 rpm in knitting process\r\n○ Online Supply System - spreading during production - bandwidth up to 200 mm - 3K up to 50K - possible output: up to 1.6 m/min\r\n○ Offline Supply System - bandwidth up to 600 mm - 12K up to 50K - possible output: up to 4.8 m/min\r\n○ Transport Chain - reinforced, reliable feeding - fixing of tapes in multiplex Pin - System\r\n○ Conveyor Belt - fully support of weft plies up to the knitting unit - synchronized movement to the transport chains\r\n○ Warp-yarn feeding - Unwinding Frame for Tape Reels \r\n○ Cutting and Suction - sheer cutting system \r\n○ Take-up batching": 1,
